1
00:00:00,466 --> 00:00:02,550
Hi, I'm Fuqiao Xue

2
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:05,200
and I lead the Internationalization Activity

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,616
at the W3C

4
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:09,733
We work to make sure the web is usable for everyone

5
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:12,816
no matter their language, script, or culture.

6
00:00:13,416 --> 00:00:16,733
What if I told you that one simple HTML attribute

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,650
one that takes about ten seconds to add

8
00:00:19,716 --> 00:00:22,850
could dramatically improve your site's accessibility

9
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,650
boost its SEO, and even make it look better?

10
00:00:27,233 --> 00:00:29,116
It sounds too good to be true

11
00:00:29,116 --> 00:00:33,016
but it's not. I'm talking about the lang attribute.

12
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:35,733
You’ve probably seen it before.

13
00:00:36,083 --> 00:00:38,566
This little piece of code tells the browser

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:41,766
and any other software that processes the page

15
00:00:41,833 --> 00:00:44,966
what human language the content is written in

16
00:00:45,516 --> 00:00:48,200
While we usually put it on the `<html>` element

17
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,533
for the whole page

18
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:52,716
you can also use it on specific parts of the page

19
00:00:52,716 --> 00:00:55,700
if you have content in multiple languages

20
00:00:56,466 --> 00:01:00,733
For XML-based formats, you might see xml:lang

21
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,850
which does the same job.

22
00:01:03,516 --> 00:01:07,166
So, why is this tiny attribute so important?

23
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:09,100
Let's break it down.

24
00:01:09,316 --> 00:01:12,166
Imagine a user who relies on a screen reader.

25
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:15,133
This software converts text to speech.

26
00:01:15,433 --> 00:01:17,416
If you don't declare the language

27
00:01:17,466 --> 00:01:19,450
the screen reader has to guess.

28
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:21,533
By declaring the language

29
00:01:21,716 --> 00:01:23,950
you ensure that assistive technologies

30
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:26,166
can use the correct pronunciation

31
00:01:26,316 --> 00:01:29,816
providing an understandable experience for all users.

32
00:01:30,916 --> 00:01:33,400
The lang attribute also has a direct impact

33
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:36,933
on how the browser renders your page. For example,

34
00:01:37,233 --> 00:01:39,066
once you add the lang attribute

35
00:01:39,066 --> 00:01:42,000
the browser knows the language's hyphenation rules

36
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:43,933
and can break words correctly.

37
00:01:44,633 --> 00:01:47,050
It can also influence font selection.

38
00:01:47,750 --> 00:01:50,350
Some characters are used in multiple languages

39
00:01:50,350 --> 00:01:53,100
but with subtle differences in glyph design.

40
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:55,266
By declaring the language

41
00:01:55,266 --> 00:01:57,100
you give the browser a hint

42
00:01:57,433 --> 00:01:59,866
to choose a font that is typographically

43
00:01:59,866 --> 00:02:01,766
appropriate for that language

44
00:02:02,116 --> 00:02:03,733
improving readability.

45
00:02:04,716 --> 00:02:07,016
And the benefits don't stop there.

46
00:02:07,516 --> 00:02:10,350
The lang attribute also helps browsers with styling

47
00:02:10,350 --> 00:02:12,016
using language attributes

48
00:02:12,550 --> 00:02:16,233
spell checking in forms, and enables machine translation

49
00:02:16,233 --> 00:02:18,250
services to work correctly.

50
00:02:18,966 --> 00:02:22,416
It's a signal that benefits the entire web ecosystem.

51
00:02:22,833 --> 00:02:23,200
So let's recap. By adding one simple attribute, lang,

52
00:02:27,666 --> 00:02:29,433
you create a better experience

53
00:02:29,433 --> 00:02:31,733
for users of assistive technology

54
00:02:32,050 --> 00:02:35,166
you improve your site's visibility on search engines

55
00:02:35,516 --> 00:02:37,716
and you help the browser render your content

56
00:02:37,716 --> 00:02:39,816
more beautifully and correctly.

57
00:02:40,666 --> 00:02:42,550
It's one of the easiest and most

58
00:02:42,550 --> 00:02:44,816
important things you can do for your website

59
00:02:45,516 --> 00:02:47,700
Go check your projects right now.

60
00:02:48,033 --> 00:02:51,533
If that lang attribute is missing, add it.

